# Reading Python, Piece by Piece

You just saw variables and data types as concepts. In Lesson 4, students write this same kind of code themselves to build their first chatbot: starting with a program that only prints a message, then one that stores information in a variable and prints it. Try the interactive below to walk through that same progression yourself.

